            "review_title": "Review at Bo Ne Lan Huong",
            "review_text": "Sparta\nMelbourne, Australia649 contributions\n0\nOMG Definitely come here for Breakfast\nJun 2019 • Family\nOk peoples, my local friend and his wife brought me here after I told him I wanted Bo Ne, this place didn’t disappoint at all. \n\nThe sizzling beef, egg, pate, onions and Bahn Mi were unbelievable. I can’t believe this was my first time eating this breakfast dish (although I would eat it anytime).\n\nDon’t worry about breakfast at ur hotel, skip it and come here. It’s a local place that’s clean and the staff are friendly and seemed happy to see a foreigner eating with local friends. \n\nOh, you also get a side bowl of soup broth, that yummy clear broth with spring onions.\n\nCome here trust me, 9 times to Vietnam and I’ve discovered a gem.\n\nThe price is $3 to $4 AUD\nRead more\nWritten June 23, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
